@startuml 08-dashboard-flows
!include _theme.iuml
title perf-dashboard - main flows
autonumber "<b>[00]"

actor Tester as T
box "perf-dashboard pod" #F4F8FF
  participant "React app" as UI #E3EEFF
  participant "Flask API" as API #EFE8FB
  participant "Java\n(convert-lr)" as J #F4F6F8
end box
box "Kubernetes" #F3FBF5
  participant "Kubernetes API" as K #E3EEFF
  participant "worker pods" as W #E3F6E8
end box
box "Storage" #FFFAF0
  database "MinIO" as M #FFF3D9
end box

== Test plans ==
T -[#B59F3B]> UI : create suite / upload zip or folder / edit file
UI -[#B59F3B]> API : POST /api/plans, /upload, PUT /file
API -> API : check names, paths, sizes, YAML syntax
API -[#B59F3B]> M : put test-plans/SUITE/...

== Import LoadRunner script ==
T -[#B59F3B]> UI : VuGen folder or zip + new suite name
UI -[#B59F3B]> API : POST /api/plans/import-lr
API -> API : keep script files only, find Action*.c
API -[#B59F3B]> J : perf convert-lr DIR --out DIR (256 MB, 60 s)
J -[#B59F3B]-> API : plan, API catalog, data, conversion report
API -[#B59F3B]> M : put test-plans/SUITE/... (nothing if any step failed)
API -[#B59F3B]-> UI : notes + next steps

== Start a run ==
T -[#2F6FD6]> UI : New run (suite, plan, workers, env)
UI -[#2F6FD6]> API : POST /api/loadtests
API -[#B59F3B]> M : plan file exists in the suite?
API -[#2F6FD6]> K : create LoadTest (plan.s3 = suite)
API -[#2F6FD6]-> UI : run created - open Run detail

== Live view (while Running) ==
loop every 3 s
  UI -[#17A2B8]> API : GET /api/loadtests/NS/NAME, /metrics
  API -[#2F6FD6]> K : LoadTest status, Jobs, Pods
  API -[#17A2B8]> W : GET /metrics on every running worker (parallel)
  API -[#17A2B8]-> UI : per-worker + summed counters\n(finished workers keep their last numbers)
end

== Final numbers and report ==
UI -[#D98E04]> API : GET /summary
API -[#D98E04]> M : report/summary.json + logs/worker-i.json
T -[#D98E04]> UI : Open report
UI -[#D98E04]> API : GET /reports/runs/RUN/report/merged/index.html (+ js, css)
API -[#D98E04]> M : stream objects (only under runs/, no ..)

== Delete ==
T -[#C0392B]> UI : Delete run (+ results) / History: Delete
UI -[#C0392B]> API : DELETE /api/loadtests/NS/NAME?results=true\nor /api/runs/FOLDER
API -[#2F6FD6]> K : run still active? then 409
API -[#C0392B]> M : delete runs/RUN/ (logs, report, summary, tests copy)
API -[#2F6FD6]> K : delete LoadTest (Jobs, pods go with it)

legend right
  <b>Arrows</b>
  |<#B59F3B><color:#FFFFFF> test plans / import </color>|
  |<#2F6FD6><color:#FFFFFF> runs, Kubernetes </color>|
  |<#17A2B8><color:#FFFFFF> live metrics </color>|
  |<#D98E04><color:#FFFFFF> results, reports </color>|
  |<#C0392B><color:#FFFFFF> delete </color>|
endlegend
@enduml
